# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day27

## Question

Tell me about a time when you had a problem while traveling or going somewhere.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- Where you were going
- What problem happened
- Why it happened
- What you did to solve it
- How the situation ended

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> The problem was that...

Also try to use:

> So I decided to...

> Luckily,...

> In the end,...

---

## Recommended Structure

I remember when...

↓

The problem was that...

↓

So I decided to...

↓

Then I...

↓

Luckily,...

↓

In the end,...

↓

It worked out well.
